        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: Boy Hits Car, The Invisible\n- Albums: All That Led Us Here, My Animal, The Invisible, Rispah\n- Places: Europe\n- Events: European tour, Mercury Prize\n\nFacts:\n- My Animal, released in 1998, is the debut album by the American rock band Boy Hits Car.\n- The Invisible is the self-titled debut album by the English band The Invisible, and it was released on 9 March 2009.\n- The Invisible was nominated for the Mercury Prize and was selected as iTunes critics' choice for album of the year.\n- Rispah is the second album by the English band The Invisible.\n- In May 2014, Boy Hits Car released All That Led Us Here as their fifth studio album.\n- After releasing All That Led Us Here, Boy Hits Car followed it with a European tour.",
